          "heading": "Exeter boss Rob Baxter backs uncapped Fisilau for England's Nations Championship",
          "body": "Exeter's Greg Fisilau, uncapped at 23 and in Steve Borthwick's squad for this month's Nations Championship matches, would adapt well to Test rugby, according to his club boss. Baxter says the number eight's strength is getting in and around the ball, and expects that to carry up a level. He has started every Premiership and European match for Exeter this season and scored seven league tries last season."
