          "kicker": "Rival verdict",
          "heading": "Kitshoff tips Les Bleus as the Springboks' biggest hurdle this month",
          "body": "Former Springboks prop Steven Kitshoff, speaking on the For The Love Of Rugby: South Africa podcast, says France will be the biggest hurdle in the Springboks' European leg and the match making South Africans most nervous. He expects a battle of attrition, with tactical kicking and a contest of who can outsmart whom rather than a set-piece shootout. Ben Youngs, the former England scrumhalf, argues Les Bleus must shake off the psychological scars of their Marseille win over the Boks in 2022."
        },
