          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Quesada calls up former Pumas flyhalf Domingo Miotti for Springboks Test",
          "body": "Montpellier flyhalf Domingo Miotti, a former Argentina Test player, is in Quesada's squad for Saturday's Test against the Springboks, his first call-up. He qualifies through an Italian grandfather and last played for Los Pumas on 9 July 2022, which is the basis of his eligibility. Quesada said: \"Domingo is a great player and an excellent person.\" The call gives Quesada four flyhalf options alongside Paolo Garbisi, Tommaso Allan and Giacomo Da Re, and Miotti, who missed last week with injury, can now resume training as normal."
