          "heading": "Ignacio Calles called up to Argentina XV after Bernasconi knock",
          "body": "Álvaro Galindo has reshaped his Argentina XV for Friday's England A match at Bath after Bautista Bernasconi took a knock in Benetton's URC game against Edinburgh and will not play. The replacement is Ignacio Calles, a 31-year-old Bayonne prop with eight Test caps who has not been picked for Los Pumas in 2026. Benetton front-rower Matías Medrano was also sent off in that same match."
